## Upgrades in Shop

**Decided ideas:** Floppy disks for upgrades, a PvZ-style car shop, a funnel-drop mechanic, and roguelite-style upgrades (concept only).

**Still to decide:**
- [ ] What do floppy disk upgrades actually unlock or change?
- [ ] Define the roguelite upgrade system — per-run or permanent?
- [ ] Full shop catalog and pricing

